<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>BenchGo SuperAgent 全链路架构</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f5f7fb;
      --paper: #ffffff;
      --ink: #162033;
      --muted: #607089;
      --line: #c9d3e2;
      --blue: #2563eb;
      --blue-soft: #eaf2ff;
      --violet: #7c3aed;
      --violet-soft: #f1ebff;
      --green: #15803d;
      --green-soft: #eaf8ef;
      --amber: #b45309;
      --amber-soft: #fff4df;
      --red: #b42318;
      --red-soft: #fff0ee;
      --shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(35, 54, 86, .10);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, #eef4ff 0, transparent 36%), var(--bg);
      font: 15px/1.55 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    }
    .wrap { max-width: 1480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 36px 28px 64px; }
    header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    h3 { margin: 0 0 7px; font-size: 16px; }
    p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .subtitle { color: var(--muted); max-width: 800px; font-size: 16px; }
    .badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #e8f8ee; color: #176b39; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
    .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #21a65a; }
    .panel { background: rgba(255,255,255,.88); border: 1px solid #e2e8f2; border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 24px; margin-top: 22px; }
    .architecture { overflow-x: auto; }
    svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 1120px; height: auto; }
    .svg-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; fill: var(--ink); }
    .svg-label { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--ink); }
    .svg-small { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--muted); }
    .node { stroke-width: 1.4; }
    .node-blue { fill: var(--blue-soft); stroke: #8db6ff; }
    .node-violet { fill: var(--violet-soft); stroke: #b59af5; }
    .node-green { fill: var(--green-soft); stroke: #91d6a6; }
    .node-amber { fill: var(--amber-soft); stroke: #e8bb78; }
    .node-red { fill: var(--red-soft); stroke: #efaaa4; }
    .zone { fill: #fbfcfe; stroke: #dbe3ee; stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 5; }
    .flow { stroke: #4a6384; stroke-width: 2; fill: none; marker-end: url(#arrow); }
    .flow-dashed { stroke: #8292aa; stroke-width: 1.7; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 6 5; marker-end: url(#arrow-muted); }
    .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 18px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 12px; }
    .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
    .swatch { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
    .card { border: 1px solid #e2e8f2; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px; background: #fff; }
    .card p { color: var(--muted); }
    .card ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .sequence { overflow-x: auto; }
    .seq-wrap { min-width: 1160px; }
    .seq-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 180px repeat(8, 1fr); align-items: center; min-height: 52px; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf1f6; }
    .seq-head { background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid #edf1f6; }
    .seq-cell { padding: 9px 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); border-left: 1px solid #edf1f6; min-height: 52px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .seq-cell.actor { font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); border-left: 0; }
    .seq-cell.action { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 650; position: relative; }
    .seq-cell.action::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -1px; right: -1px; top: 50%; border-top: 2px solid var(--blue); z-index: 0; }
    .seq-cell.action span { position: relative; z-index: 1; background: #fff; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 5px; }
    .step { display: inline-block; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; line-height: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin-right: 5px; }
    .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .callout { border-left: 4px solid var(--blue); background: #f1f6ff; padding: 13px 15px; border-radius: 8px; color: #28456e; }
    footer { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 24px; }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .wrap { padding: 24px 14px 44px; } header { display: block; } .badge { margin-top: 16px; } .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .panel { padding: 16px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div>
        <h1>SuperAgent 全链路架构</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">BenchGo 中从用户输入、任务编排、Harness 执行，到验收、交付与记忆沉淀的当前实现视图。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>本地闭环已具备 · 449/449 测试通过</div>
    </header>

    <section class="panel architecture">
      <h2>一、运行时总架构</h2>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1400 760" role="img" aria-label="SuperAgent 运行时总架构图">
        <defs>
          <marker id="arrow" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="8" refY="4.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L9,4.5 L0,9 z" fill="#4a6384"/></marker>
          <marker id="arrow-muted" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="8" refY="4.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L9,4.5 L0,9 z" fill="#8292aa"/></marker>
        </defs>

        <rect class="zone" x="18" y="18" width="260" height="158" rx="18"/>
        <text class="svg-title" x="38" y="48">输入与入口</text>
        <rect class="node node-blue" x="38" y="70" width="100" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="88" y="95" text-anchor="middle">桌面客户端</text>
        <rect class="node node-blue" x="158" y="70" width="100" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="208" y="95" text-anchor="middle">HTTP / API</text>
        <rect class="node node-blue" x="38" y="124" width="100" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="88" y="149" text-anchor="middle">飞书消息</text>
        <rect class="node node-blue" x="158" y="124" width="100" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="208" y="149" text-anchor="middle">Schedule</text>

        <rect class="zone" x="310" y="18" width="360" height="158" rx="18"/>
        <text class="svg-title" x="330" y="48">SuperAgent 接入层</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="330" y="70" width="146" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="403" y="95" text-anchor="middle">intake</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="494" y="70" width="146" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="567" y="95" text-anchor="middle">权限 / Policy Gate</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="330" y="124" width="146" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="403" y="149" text-anchor="middle">Trigger 去重</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="494" y="124" width="146" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="567" y="149" text-anchor="middle">Subscription / Attention</text>

        <rect class="zone" x="702" y="18" width="330" height="158" rx="18"/>
        <text class="svg-title" x="722" y="48">判断与编排</text>
        <rect class="node node-amber" x="722" y="70" width="130" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="787" y="95" text-anchor="middle">Assessment / Eval</text>
        <rect class="node node-amber" x="872" y="70" width="130" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="937" y="95" text-anchor="middle">Router</text>
        <rect class="node node-amber" x="722" y="124" width="130" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="787" y="149" text-anchor="middle">Ticket</text>
        <rect class="node node-amber" x="872" y="124" width="130" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="937" y="149" text-anchor="middle">Mandate / Assignment</text>

        <rect class="zone" x="1064" y="18" width="318" height="158" rx="18"/>
        <text class="svg-title" x="1084" y="48">执行边界</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="1084" y="70" width="128" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1148" y="95" text-anchor="middle">Assignment Worker</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="1232" y="70" width="128" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1296" y="95" text-anchor="middle">Executor</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="1084" y="124" width="128" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1148" y="149" text-anchor="middle">Harness Agent</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="1232" y="124" width="128" height="42" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1296" y="149" text-anchor="middle">隔离 Session / Worktree</text>

        <path class="flow" d="M278 96 H330"/><path class="flow" d="M640 96 H722"/><path class="flow" d="M1002 96 H1084"/>
        <path class="flow-dashed" d="M278 145 H330"/><path class="flow-dashed" d="M640 145 H722"/><path class="flow-dashed" d="M1002 145 H1084"/>

        <rect class="zone" x="18" y="220" width="660" height="222" rx="18"/>
        <text class="svg-title" x="38" y="250">执行治理与资源边界（由 assignment-executor 安装）</text>
        <rect class="node node-red" x="38" y="276" width="142" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="109" y="302" text-anchor="middle">Permission Gate</text>
        <rect class="node node-red" x="198" y="276" width="142" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="269" y="302" text-anchor="middle">Vault / Credentials</text>
        <rect class="node node-red" x="358" y="276" width="142" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="429" y="302" text-anchor="middle">Goal / Budget</text>
        <rect class="node node-red" x="518" y="276" width="142" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="589" y="302" text-anchor="middle">Key Pool</text>
        <rect class="node node-red" x="38" y="342" width="142" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="109" y="368" text-anchor="middle">Attention</text>
        <rect class="node node-red" x="198" y="342" width="142" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="269" y="368" text-anchor="middle">Checkpoint</text>
        <rect class="node node-red" x="358" y="342" width="142" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="429" y="368" text-anchor="middle">Retry / Resume</text>
        <rect class="node node-red" x="518" y="342" width="142" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="589" y="368" text-anchor="middle">Watchdog</text>
        <path class="flow-dashed" d="M1220 176 V276 H660"/>

        <rect class="zone" x="702" y="220" width="680" height="222" rx="18"/>
        <text class="svg-title" x="722" y="250">结果验收与交付</text>
        <rect class="node node-amber" x="722" y="276" width="150" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="797" y="302" text-anchor="middle">Run / Evidence</text>
        <rect class="node node-amber" x="892" y="276" width="150" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="967" y="302" text-anchor="middle">Ticket Review</text>
        <rect class="node node-amber" x="1062" y="276" width="150" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1137" y="302" text-anchor="middle">Outbox</text>
        <rect class="node node-blue" x="1232" y="276" width="130" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1297" y="302" text-anchor="middle">Delivery Worker</text>
        <rect class="node node-blue" x="807" y="350" width="150" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="882" y="376" text-anchor="middle">桌面交付</text>
        <rect class="node node-blue" x="977" y="350" width="150" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1052" y="376" text-anchor="middle">飞书回执</text>
        <rect class="node node-blue" x="1147" y="350" width="150" height="44" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1222" y="376" text-anchor="middle">Attention 通知</text>
        <path class="flow" d="M1296 176 V276"/><path class="flow" d="M872 298 H892"/><path class="flow" d="M1042 298 H1062"/><path class="flow" d="M1212 298 H1232"/>
        <path class="flow" d="M1297 320 V350 H1297"/><path class="flow-dashed" d="M1297 320 V372 H882"/><path class="flow-dashed" d="M1297 320 V372 H1052"/><path class="flow-dashed" d="M1297 320 V372 H1222"/>

        <rect class="zone" x="18" y="486" width="1364" height="232" rx="18"/>
        <text class="svg-title" x="38" y="516">持久化、记忆与配置（横向支撑全链路）</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="38" y="548" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="133" y="576" text-anchor="middle">SQLite 控制面</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="248" y="548" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="343" y="576" text-anchor="middle">Harness 日志 / Session</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="458" y="548" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="553" y="576" text-anchor="middle">Ledger / FTS5</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="668" y="548" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="763" y="576" text-anchor="middle">Markdown 记忆</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="878" y="548" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="973" y="576" text-anchor="middle">Review / Learning</text>
        <rect class="node node-violet" x="1088" y="548" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1183" y="576" text-anchor="middle">Skills / 候选审核</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="38" y="628" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="133" y="656" text-anchor="middle">BenchGo 配置</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="248" y="628" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="343" y="656" text-anchor="middle">连接 / 模型选择</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="458" y="628" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="553" y="656" text-anchor="middle">任务 / 订阅设置</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="668" y="628" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="763" y="656" text-anchor="middle">Desktop / HTTP 服务</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="878" y="628" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="973" y="656" text-anchor="middle">Feishu Adapter</text>
        <rect class="node node-green" x="1088" y="628" width="190" height="48" rx="10"/><text class="svg-label" x="1183" y="656" text-anchor="middle">Schedule Bridge</text>
        <path class="flow-dashed" d="M80 442 V548"/><path class="flow-dashed" d="M440 442 V548"/><path class="flow-dashed" d="M800 442 V548"/><path class="flow-dashed" d="M1160 442 V548"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="legend">
        <span><i class="swatch" style="background:var(--blue-soft);border-color:#8db6ff"></i>入口与交付</span>
        <span><i class="swatch" style="background:var(--violet-soft);border-color:#b59af5"></i>接入与持久化</span>
        <span><i class="swatch" style="background:var(--amber-soft);border-color:#e8bb78"></i>判断、工单与验收</span>
        <span><i class="swatch" style="background:var(--green-soft);border-color:#91d6a6"></i>执行与配置</span>
        <span><i class="swatch" style="background:var(--red-soft);border-color:#efaaa4"></i>执行治理边界</span>
        <span>实线：主流程　虚线：支撑或异步关系</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel sequence">
      <h2>二、一次请求的时序</h2>
      <div class="seq-wrap">
        <div class="seq-row seq-head">
          <div class="seq-cell actor">阶段</div><div class="seq-cell actor">用户 / 飞书</div><div class="seq-cell actor">intake</div><div class="seq-cell actor">Assessment</div><div class="seq-cell actor">Router</div><div class="seq-cell actor">Ticket / Assignment</div><div class="seq-cell actor">Harness</div><div class="seq-cell actor">Review</div><div class="seq-cell actor">Delivery</div>
        </div>
        <div class="seq-row"><div class="seq-cell actor"><span class="step">1</span>输入</div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>发送消息 / 请求</span></div><div class="seq-cell">接收</div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div></div>
        <div class="seq-row"><div class="seq-cell actor"><span class="step">2</span>准入</div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>校验 actor、thread、policy</span></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div></div>
        <div class="seq-row"><div class="seq-cell actor"><span class="step">3</span>去重</div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>sourceKey 去重并写入 Trigger</span></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div></div>
        <div class="seq-row"><div class="seq-cell actor"><span class="step">4</span>评估</div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>Candidate / Eval</span></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>选择路径</span></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div></div>
        <div class="seq-row"><div class="seq-cell actor"><span class="step">5</span>建单</div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>创建 Ticket、Mandate、Assignment</span></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div></div>
        <div class="seq-row"><div class="seq-cell actor"><span class="step">6</span>执行</div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>领取任务</span></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>创建 / 恢复 Agent Session</span></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div></div>
        <div class="seq-row"><div class="seq-cell actor"><span class="step">7</span>验收</div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>提交结果与 Evidence</span></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>验证证据并 Review</span></div><div class="seq-cell"></div></div>
        <div class="seq-row"><div class="seq-cell actor"><span class="step">8</span>交付</div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>写 Outbox，桌面 / 飞书回执</span></div></div>
        <div class="seq-row"><div class="seq-cell actor"><span class="step">9</span>沉淀</div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell"></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>Review / Learning</span></div><div class="seq-cell action"><span>记忆、技能候选</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>三、当前实现边界</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card"><h3>已形成的本地闭环</h3><p>输入 → intake → Assessment / Router → Ticket / Assignment → Harness Agent / Session → Evidence → Review → Outbox → 交付。</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>执行时的硬边界</h3><p>Permission Gate、Vault、Attention、Goal / Budget、Key Pool、Worktree、Checkpoint、Watchdog 和 Retry / Resume 由执行器统一安装。</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>仍需外部验收</h3><p>真实供应商请求、真实飞书凭据和群聊链路、重启后交付、目标服务与图片模型等外部依赖尚未完成产品级验收。</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="callout" style="margin-top:16px">说明：此页面是当前源码的结构化说明，文件可直接双击打开；不依赖构建工具或外部 CDN。</div>
    </section>

    <footer>来源：plugins/superagent/src、plugins/superagent/client、docs/06-superagent/服务契约.md 与现状文档。生成日期：2026-11-03。</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
